flowchart LR
    User[User] --> Web[Next.js Frontend]
    Web --> API[FastAPI Backend]

    API --> DB[(PostgreSQL + pgvector)]
    API --> Redis[(Redis)]
    API --> LLM[OpenAI-Compatible Chat API]
    API --> EmbedLocal[Ollama Local Embedding]
    API --> EmbedCloud[OpenAI-Compatible Embedding Fallback]

    Redis --> Worker[RQ Worker]
    Worker --> Storage[Local File Storage]
    Worker --> DB
    Worker --> EmbedLocal
    Worker -. optional .-> EmbedCloud

    DB --> API
    API --> Web

    subgraph FrontendRoutes[Frontend Routes]
        Home[/Workbench Chat/]
        Retrieval[/Retrieval Playground/]
        Eval[/Eval Workspace/]
        Metrics[/Metrics Dashboard/]
    end

    Web --> Home
    Web --> Retrieval
    Web --> Eval
    Web --> Metrics

    subgraph ProjectIsolation[Project Isolation]
        ProjectID[project_id]
        Docs[documents]
        Chunks[chunks]
        Conversations[conversations]
        Logs[retrieval logs]
        EvalRows[eval datasets, runs, results]
        ChatMetrics[chat request metrics]
        ProjectID --> Docs
        ProjectID --> Chunks
        ProjectID --> Conversations
        ProjectID --> Logs
        ProjectID --> EvalRows
        ProjectID --> ChatMetrics
    end

    API -. every retrieval/chat/eval/metrics query filters by .-> ProjectID
